 "description": "\"Find royalty-free / Creative Commons / public-domain images of [X]\" / \"CC images of [Y]\" / \"free-to-use pictures of [topic]\" / \"stock photos of [subject]\" \u2014 search Creative-Commons-licensed images across Wikimedia, Flickr, Met Museum, Smithsonian, and many other open repositories via Openverse. Filter by license (cc0, by, by-sa, \u2026), commercial-use, size. Use to find legally-reusable images for slides, blog posts, marketing, education.",
